{"availability":"available","full":"telepath-computer/television","name":"television","description":"The missing GUI for personal agents. Television gives you and your agent a visual space for creating and working with artifacts. ","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":100,"forks":7,"created":"2026-10-01T00:05:45Z","updated":"2026-10-03T17:51:26Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://television.run","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","stars":100,"forks":7}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Television is the missing GUI for your personal agent. It gives you a visual space for creating and working with artifacts in collaboration with your agent. It works with any agent and any model.","To use Television, you talk to your agent like you normally do. But instead of just producing textual chat responses, your agent can now create visual artifacts, put them on your Television, and modify them over time. Artifacts are persistent, malleable, and can even be interactive. They can display documents, data, visualizations, live web pages, even your vibe-coded apps and interfaces.","We're a software company working on interfaces for the next era of personal computers. We believe fundamental changes in personal computing have always been accompanied by new interface metaphors that help bring those changes to the masses. Television is just the beginning. Learn more about us."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/telepath-computer/television/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5e563dc93cc1de3882fce5a7889e1bac50465691e099fd18bd14f95fbb1380e2","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","projectInsights":